    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='ReadMe'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ContentQualityScore/ReadMe?rev=' id='ReadMe' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ContentQualityScore' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1400' maxwidth='1500' minheight='1400' minwidth='1500' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='49429' id='3' type-v2='text' w='72866' x='10467' y='571'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>DASHBOARD PURPOSE:</run>
              <run>
- This dashboard is aimed to deliver Global Content Quality Score

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>SCORE MEASUREMENT APPROACH:</run>
              <run>
- The score is a single metric that incorporates both food &amp; QC (for now, only food is included)
- Food score:
          - 3 elements tracked: </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>Vendor Level Picture</run>
              <run> (VLP) &amp; </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>Dish Level Picture</run>
              <run> (DLP) &amp; </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>Dish Level Description</run>
              <run> (DLD)
          - Each element with it&apos;s own weight based on business impact
                   - </run>
              <run bold='true'>Image :       </run>
              <run>Dish Level Picture Coverage -                  </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>20%</run>
              <run>&#10;                   - </run>
              <run bold='true'>Image :       </run>
              <run>Dish Level Picture Quality -                      </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>16%</run>
              <run>&#10;                   - </run>
              <run bold='true'>Image :       </run>
              <run>Vendor Listing Picture Quality  -           </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>24%</run>
              <run>&#10;                   - </run>
              <run bold='true'>Text:            </run>
              <run>Dish Level Description Coverage -        </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>20%</run>
              <run>&#10;                   - </run>
              <run bold='true'>Text:            </run>
              <run>Dish Level Description Quality -            </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' italic='true'>20%</run>
              <run>
          - High focus on pictures
- QC content score:
          - Elements tracked with focus on impact and relevance (categories, brands, etc.)
          - Products image quality measurement added
          - Weights adjusted based on business impact

</run>
              <run bold='true'>Two approaches of score calulation:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run italic='true'>    - GID-based score calculation (is used on the Sum Up list):</run>
              <run>
          * score is calculated as average of scores that all vendors in that particular location have.
</run>
              <run italic='true'>    - Vendor-based  value calculation (is used on the Deep Dive list)::</run>
              <run>
          * score is calculated as average of all vendors in the sample.

</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>KEY DEFINITIONS:</run>
              <run>&#10;      * </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>DLPC</run>
              <run>: Dish Level Picture Coverage
      * </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>DLPQ</run>
              <run>: Dish Level Picture Quality
      * </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>VLPQ</run>
              <run>: Vendor Listing Picture Quality
      * </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>DLDC</run>
              <run>: Dish Level Description Coverage
      * </run>
              <run bold='true' italic='true'>DLDQ</run>
              <run>: Dish Level Description Quality</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='98858' id='27' type-v2='empty' w='9934' x='533' y='571'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='91072' id='28' type-v2='empty' w='16134' x='83333' y='8357'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='7786' id='29' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Delivery-Hero-Logo-Red.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='16134' x='83333' y='571'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
